%S A400327 5,73,2674,76913,1134068,186764394,14542026085,686770523397,
%T A400327 184430518825474
%N A400327 Smallest positive integer that can be written as the sum of n distinct positive n-th powers and also as the sum of n+1 distinct positive (n+1)-th powers.
%e A400327 First terms:
%e A400327 5 = 5^1 = 1^2 + 2^2.
%e A400327 73 = 3^2 + 8^2 = 1^3 + 2^3 + 4^3.
%e A400327 2674 = 7^3 + 10^3 + 11^3 = 1^4 + 2^4 + 4^4 + 7^4.
%e A400327 76913 = 3^4 + 6^4 + 10^4 + 16^4 = 1^5 + 2^5 + 4^5 + 7^5 + 9^5.
%e A400327 1134068 = 2^5 + 3^5 + 5^5 + 13^5 + 15^5 = 1^6 + 2^6 + 3^6 + 5^6 + 7^6 + 10^6.
%Y A400327 Cf. A001481, A001661, A003072, A393788, A347362, A146756, A400781.
